<title>FRANCE: Skis Rossignol first-half profit falls.</title>
<headline>Skis Rossignol first-half profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net consolidated			  129.03  vs	  148.47</p>
<p>    Operating				   206.11  vs	  241.56</p>
<p>    Pre-tax, pre-exceptional		203.82  vs	  220.33</p>
<p>    Turnover				  1,209.91  vs	1,140.14</p>
<p>NOTE - Skis Rossignol published its results in a financial media notice.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
